 0 November 2026) in Campu Cetatii\, Transylvania\, on the theme Night as C
 ommons and the Dark Side of Light: night\, darkness\, and light pollution\
 , a strong fit for media and installation practices. Support: EUR 30/day a
 llowance\, accommodation\, travel allowance (EUR 400 under 5\,000 km\, EUR
