 GIBILITY: artists based in Creative Europe countries except Romania. Deadl
 ine 1 August 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Hypha etc.\nLocation: Campu Cetatii\, 
 Transylvania\, Romania. For artists based in Creative Europe countries exc
 ept Romania (Netherlands eligible).\nAward: EUR 30/day allowance\, plus ac
 commodation and travel (EUR 400 under 5\,000 km\; EUR 800 over)\, with gre
 en mobility\, family\, and accessibility top-ups. EU-funded. 6 weeks. No a
 pplication fee.\nDuration: Residency 1 October to 10 November 2026.\n\nMor
 e: https://www.hypha-etc.ro/events/call-for-applications-night-as-commons-
 and-the-dark-side-of-light?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_mediu
 m=referral
